  "title": "wslua: Fix integer validation signedness",
  "description": "Previously, when a signed value was passed to TreeItem:add or TreeItem:add_le, and the ProtoField declared it as a signed integer, the value was checked to be an unsigned integer instead.\n\nFound when investigating issue with MAVLink Wireshark dissector where negative value displays as 0: https://github.com/mavlink/mavlink/issues/2073\nI'm not sure if this is actually responsible for the observed behavior.",
